   <narrative xml:lang="SV">De viktigaste f&#xf6;rv&#xe4;ntade resultaten f&#xf6;r ICMP s Slutf&#xf6;rande strategi   f&#xf6;r v&#xe4;stra Balkan 2011-2013 &#xe4;r 1) att regeringarna tar ansvar f&#xf6;r     fr&#xe5;gan om f&#xf6;rsvunna personer, har 2) det civila samh&#xe4;llet befogenhet  och 3) forts&#xe4;ttning av identifieringar.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The key expected results for ICMP&apos;s Completion Strategy for the       Western Balkans 2011-2013 are 1) that governments take responsibility for the issue of missing persons, 2) civil society is empowered and   3) continuation of identifications.</narrative>
